Package: ros-agent
Version: @VERSION@
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: python3 (>= 3.9), dconf-cli, systemd
Maintainer: ROS Project <yvesm189@users.noreply.github.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/yvesm189/ros
Description: ROS management agent
 Enrolls a ROS workstation with a ROS Console server, reports hardware and
 operating system inventory on a timer, and applies the GNOME desktop policy
 the server returns by writing a system dconf database.
 .
 The agent uses only the Python standard library and does nothing at all until
 a server URL is configured, so it is safe to ship in an unmanaged image.
